WEBVTT

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.920
(Jacob) Albert, don't
forget the pierogis.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.280
(Albert) Yes, Mr. K.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.920
Albert.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
No more than eight minutes
on the kolaczkis.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.040
Yes, Mr. K.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.160
He's a sweet kid.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.600
He doesn't know the difference
between paszteciki and golabki.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.760
-Hey, sweetheart. -(shouts) What?

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.360
Newt doesn't know what
you're talking about.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.800
I don't know what
you're talking about.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.760
And you are not working
today, remember?

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.080
-(Jacob) Oh! -(Queenie giggles)

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.920
Oh, are you all right, honey?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.880
Oh, you're nervous about the
speech. Don't be nervous.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.960
Tell him, honey.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.080
Don't be nervous about the speech.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.000
-I'm not nervous. -(Jacob sniffs)

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.120
What is the smell? Why
is there burning?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.560
-Albert? -(Queenie chuckles)

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.520
(song playing on speaker)

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.480
Mm. Maybe we're nervous
about something else, huh?

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.280
I can't imagine what
you're talking about.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:53.480
(Queenie) Mm-hmm.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.240
(chuckles)

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.280
(bell jingles)

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.040
So, the day that I first met
Jacob...

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.080
Uh...

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:10.520
The day that I first met Jacob,

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.800
we were both sitting in
the Steen National Bank.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.720
Never would I...

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.640
(romantic music playing)

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.560
The maid of honor, I presume?

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.720
The best man, I gather?

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.720
-You've done something
to your hair. -No.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.240
Oh.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.040
Well, yes, actually, just...

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.120
Just for tonight.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.000
Well, it suits you.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:47.760
Thank you, Newt.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.200
(laughs)

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.920
(Theseus clears throat)

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.160
Oh.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.400
-(Theseus) Hello. -(Lally) Hi.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.560
Look who's...

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:56.960
Hi.

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.880
So good to see you.

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.280
-Hi. -How are you?

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.520
You look wonderful, Lally.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.760
Well, thank you, Newt.
I appreciate it.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:05.840
Good luck.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:06.840
Tina, come on.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.920
-You must tell me how MACUSA's
been. -See you inside.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.360
-(door opens) -(bell jingles)

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.600
-What about me? How do I look?
-(chuckles)

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.360
-You all right? -You look fine.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:19.360
You okay?

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:20.400
Yeah, I'm all right.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.760
You're not nervous, are you?

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.040
Can't be nervous about a speech
after saving the world. Hmm.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.560
-(door opens) -(bell jingles)

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.600
(door closes)

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.280
(Newt sighs)

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.880
It's a historic day.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:49.560
Where once was before,
there will now be after.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:56.040
Funny how historic days seem so
ordinary when you're living them.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.520
Well, perhaps that's what happens
when the world gets things right.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:02.600
Mm, it's jolly nice to know
it happens occasionally.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.720
(chuckles)

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.280
I didn't know if I'd see you here.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.680
I wasn't sure you would, either.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:11.960
-(door opens) -(Queenie) Hey, Newt.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:12.960
Yes.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.920
Jacob seems to think
he's lost the ring.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.120
Please tell me you've got it.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.040
No, it's all good. Yep.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.320
(Queenie chuckles) Whew!

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.240
That scared me. Jacob!

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:20.920
(Pick chattering)

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.000
(Newt chuckles)

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.680
Good man, Pick.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.160
I should probably, um...

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.960
Thank you, Newt.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.600
What for?

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.120
Pick your poison.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.720
I really couldn't have
done it without you.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.640
(sniffs) I'd do it again, by the
way.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.840
Should you ask.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.520
Okay.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:13.680
(Jacob) Hey.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:18.600
(muffled chatter)

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.040
(laughter)

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:24.960
-(Lally) Hey! -(Bunty) Hello!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.840
(Lally) Bunty!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.120
(in sing-song voice) Bunty!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.960
(soft music playing)

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.960
(footsteps approach slowly)

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:48.080
(Queenie chuckles softly)

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.000
(whispers) Wow, you're so
beautiful.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.640
(Queenie) Oh.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.280
I can't believe it.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.960
(muffled chatter and laughter)

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.640
(soft music continues)

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.640
(Newt) This is, um... This is
Albert.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:23.240
I don't know if you've
met Albert, yet?

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.640
Have you met Lally?

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.080
(laughter and chatter continue)

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.720
(soft music continues)

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.840
(dramatic music playing)

